{"severity":"error","file":"errors/type_mismatch_58.march","start_line":5,"start_col":13,"end_line":5,"end_col":29,"message":"expected `Scope` but got `Result(Scope, ScopeError)`.","code":"type_mismatch","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["A computed scope expression can fail, so `restrict` cannot take it directly. Bind it with `let?` first: `let? s = IO.FileRead(dir)`, then `restrict s do ... end`."],"category":"TYPE MISMATCH"}
